 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
+
+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.invoices_by_status(status)`: list invoices whose status is `status`; `status` must be `"open"` or `"paid"`. Returns a list (not `Money`), sorted by invoice id ascending; empty list if none match. Raises `E_BAD_INPUT` if `status` is any other value. Emits no events. Read-only, so safe to call repeatedly.
